 ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingResult","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingResult","text":"SENTUserLinkingResult"},{"kind":"text","text":"?, "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:objc(cs)SENTUserLinkingError","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/SENTUserLinkingError","text":"SENTUserLinkingError"},{"kind":"text","text":"?)"}],"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"parameters":[{"name":"authCode","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"A code obtained from the backend Sentiance API.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"anchor":"discussion","level":2,"text":"Discussion","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Links the Sentiance user to your app’s user, on the Sentiance Cloud Platform."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Uses the supplied authentication code to find the app user. Therefore, before calling this method, make sure that you"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"have obtained a valid code from the backend Sentiance API (thereby having initiated the first linking step). This"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"code request is authenticated using a Sentiance API key, which must never be transmitted to the app. Hence why the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"request must come from your backend."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Here are the complete steps:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Retrieve the code in your app and supply it to this method."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Initiate an authentication code request via your backend towards the Sentiance backend. This request will include"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"your app’s user identifier, which will be temporarily coupled to the code that you will receive."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The SDK will forward the code to the Sentiance backend to complete the link."}]}]}],"type":"orderedList"},{"name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"text":"With this method, a Sentiance user cannot be linked to an app user that already exists on the Sentiance","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Platform (i.e. with an app user identifier that you already supplied to Sentiance during a past authentication code","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"request). You can only link to an app user that is new to Sentiance. This is because an existing app user will","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"already have a corresponding Sentiance user on the platform, and that Sentiance user cannot be restored here anymore.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"To restore that user, you must reset the SDK and recreate a linked Sentiance user instead.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}],"style":"note","type":"aside"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This method is useful if you want to link a Sentiance user that was previously created without specifying a linker"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"in the user creation options (thereby having created an unlinked user)."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK","doc:\/\/com.sentiance.SENTSDK\/documentation\/SENTSDK\/Sentiance"]]},"sections":[],"metadata":{"externalID":"c:objc(cs)Sentiance(im)linkUserWithAuthCode:completionHandler:","title":"linkUser(authCode:completionHandler:)","role":"symbol","roleHeading":"Instance Method","modules":[{"name":"SENTSDK"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"- ","kind":"text"},{"text":"linkUserWithAuthCode:completionHandler:","kind":"identifier"}],"fra